<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<qti-assessment-item xmlns="http://www.imsglobal.org/xsd/imsqtiasi_v3p0" identifier="feedback-action" title="选择接收到反馈后的行动">
  <qti-response-declaration identifier="RESPONSE" cardinality="single" base-type="identifier">
    <qti-correct-response><qti-value>Adapt</qti-value></qti-correct-response>
    <qti-mapping default-value="0" lower-bound="0" upper-bound="2"><qti-map-entry map-key="Adapt" mapped-value="2"/><qti-map-entry map-key="Review" mapped-value="0.5"/></qti-mapping>
  </qti-response-declaration>
  <qti-outcome-declaration identifier="SCORE" cardinality="single" base-type="float"/>
  <qti-item-body>
    <qti-rubric-block view="candidate" use="instructions"><qti-content-body><p>本题必答。选择最能利用反馈改进学习的行动，可按行动质量获得部分分数。</p></qti-content-body></qti-rubric-block>
    <p>收到具体反馈后，学习者应当<qti-inline-choice-interaction response-identifier="RESPONSE" required="true" shuffle="false" data-prompt="请选择学习行动"><qti-label>学习行动</qti-label><qti-inline-choice identifier="Adapt">调整策略并再次尝试</qti-inline-choice><qti-inline-choice identifier="Review">只重读反馈</qti-inline-choice><qti-inline-choice identifier="Ignore">忽略反馈</qti-inline-choice></qti-inline-choice-interaction>。</p>
  </qti-item-body>
  <qti-response-processing template="https://purl.imsglobal.org/spec/qti/v3p0/rptemplates/map_response.xml"/>
</qti-assessment-item>
